  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">豐富生態群系</a></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/918/257/biomesoplenty.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1176\" height=\"480\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>概述</strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">「動態樹木」模組讓原版的樹木變得美麗、複雜且逼真。它大幅改進了原版樹木，以至於其他模組的樹木相比之下顯得遜色。我製作此模組是為了用動態版本替換「豐富生態群系」中的樹木，使其與「動態樹木」的樹木搭配時不會顯得突兀。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>功能特色</strong></strong></h2>\n<h4><strong>新增樹木：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>棕櫚樹</li>\n<li>橘色秋樹</li>\n<li>黃色秋樹</li>\n<li>楓樹</li>\n<li>枯萎樹</li>\n<li>枯木</li>\n<li>焦樹</li>\n<li>開花橡樹</li>\n<li>藍花楹</li>\n<li>彩虹樺樹</li>\n<li>粉櫻</li>\n<li>白櫻</li>\n<li>地獄樹</li>\n<li>柳樹</li>\n<li>冷杉</li>\n<li>桃花心木</li>\n<li>紅杉</li>\n<li>幽暗樹</li>\n<li>魔法樹</li>\n<li>黑楊</li>\n<li>雲杉楊</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>新增蘑菇（若 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictreesplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木 +</a>&nbsp;已安裝）：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>毒蕈</li>\n<li>發光菇</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>不會被替換的樹木</strong><strong>：</strong></h4>\n<h5>(1.21.1)</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>起源橡樹（經典外觀）</li>\n<li>蒼穹樹（過於複雜，無法由動態樹木適配）</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>(1.16.5)</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>起源橡樹（經典外觀）</li>\n<li>紅樹林（遊戲內無紅樹林木材）</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>(1.12.2)</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>起源橡樹（經典外觀）</li>\n<li>神聖橡樹（體型過大）</li>\n<li>巨型花朵（非樹木）</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>相容模組</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>以下模組的功能能與「動態樹木」完美融合，其相容性顯著或已明確提供支援。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/better-foliage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Foliage</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dynamic-surroundings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Surroundings</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/exotic-birds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Exotic Birds</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/tumbleweed\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tumbleweed</a></span></span>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>設定檔</strong></strong></h2>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">本模組包含設定檔，可啟用或停用以下功能：</span></p>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\">(1.12.2)</span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">柿子樹（若啟用，世界生成時會產生柿子樹，而秋季樹、楓樹和枯木將不再掉落柿子）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">桃樹（若啟用，世界生成時會產生桃樹，而開花樹、藍花楹和桃花心木將不再掉落桃子）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">梨樹（若啟用，世界生成時會產生梨樹，而紅樹林和柳樹將不再掉落梨子）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">楊樹種子（若啟用，楊樹變種將掉落專屬種子，可在叢林生態群系外種植）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>其他擴充套件</strong></strong></h2>\n<p>其他模組的「動態樹木」擴充套件可於<a href=\"https://github.com/DynamicTreesTeam/DynamicTrees/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木維基</a>中尋找。</p>\n<h4><strong>建議與請求：</strong></h4>\n<p>如需請求新增模組相容性支援，請至此處提出：&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>需求</strong></strong></h2>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木<br></a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">豐富生態群系</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>授權與模組包</strong></h2>\n<p>歡迎將本模組納入任何模組包中，無需事先取得許可。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>如有任何問題，請在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/MZ56Cuc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 上向我提問。</strong></span></p>",
